vidence / Resolved only / Needs connector 三栏 agent coverage 展示，避免用单一健康分掩盖 13 个 agent 的真实 adapter 成熟度差异。\n```","ttft_ms":16822,"type":"result","duration_ms":119021,"uuid":"308865dd-4d7d-4a9a-adcb-e592fba60ec8","ttft_stream_ms":5127,"time_to_request_ms":1820,"queued_turn_count":0}
